# workmon-collect hosts — one worker per line: <host_or_wg_ip> [asset_id]
# Copy this to /etc/workmon-collect/hosts and edit it.
#
# asset_id (the second column) is OPTIONAL. If not set — the receiving folder's
# name is taken from the worker's hostname (short name, `hostname -s`), which you
# make unique per user during hardware provisioning.
# The second column is only needed to forcibly override the name.

# Just WG addresses — names will come from the workers' hostnames:
# 10.10.0.11
# 10.10.0.12
# 10.10.0.13

# With an explicit folder name override:
# 10.10.0.20   special-kiosk
